  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell fills the area with a brilliant flash of shimmering light.\nCreatures in the area are blinded for 1d4 rounds, or dazzled for\n1d4 rounds if they succeed at a Reflex save. Evil creatures in the\narea of the burst take 1d4 points of damage per caster level (max\n5d4), whether they succeed at the Reflex save or not.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell fills the area with a brilliant flash of shimmering light.\\ncreatures in the area are blinded for 1d4 rounds, or dazzled for\\n1d4 rounds if they succeed at a reflex save. evil creatures in the\\narea of the burst take 1d4 points of damage per caster level (max\\n5d4), whether they succeed at the reflex save or not.\"",
